  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Lockeroom manufactures a range of recovery tools designed to keep active people active. The goal of all our products is to provide treatment and training support to improve posture and performance. We want people to help themselves get back better, by understanding the role that core control, mobility, stability and strength play in pain free movement. Our products include rollers, bands, reusable ice bags and a range of unique muscle triggers called Pocket Physios.</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our products are designed by leading Australian Physiotherapist, Cameron Lillicrap. An elite athlete himself, he turned his focus to helping others reach their physical goals after retirement. His products are used in the preparation and recovery programs of professional athletes througout the world but are just as effective for any active person wanting to stay active!</p></div>",
